OL,3,GNEWSANew #25m major health hub set for
OL,4,ABilston
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged for a
OL,7,Fmulti-million pound Community
OL,8,FDiagnostic Centre (CDC) in Bilston to
OL,9,Fspeed up access to medical tests and
OL,10,Fscans.
OL,12,FThe town's upcoming health and
OL,13,Fwellbeing facility, next to the WV
OL,14,FActive Bilston-Bert Williams leisure
OL,15,Fcentre, was chosen as the CDC's new
OL,16,Fhome, subject to approval from the city
OL,17,Fcouncil.
OL,19,FIt is aimed at boosting existing
OL,20,Fservices at New Cross Hospital, Cannock
OL,21,FHospital and Walsall Manor Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
