OL,3,GNEWSANew #25m major health hub set for
OL,4,ABilston
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The inclusion of the CDC means the
OL,7,Fhealth and wellbeing campus will act as
OL,8,Fan anchor, transforming primary and
OL,9,Fcommunity services and improving health
OL,10,Foutcomes for residents in Wolverhampton
OL,11,Fand Walsall," said City of
OL,12,FWolverhampton leader, Stephen Simkins.
